WEBVTT

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.300
Kaito Daimon, I command you:

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.350
Become a Phi-Brain and
solve the Puzzle of God.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.910
For me.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.750
Just what is going on?

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.540
Rook!

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.460
Who the hell are you guys?!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.220
Congratulations on your release, Kaito!

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.220
Huh?

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.910
Kimi no nounai e to shinnyuu
Gonna infiltrate your brain

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.670
Nemutteru suki ni baby, open the gate
While you're sleeping, baby, open the gate

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.500
Fukuzatsusugi security
Too-complicated security

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.250
Kakusareru to abakitakunaru
When something's hidden, it makes me want to expose it

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:16.760
Barabara ni chirabatte iru password o hiroiatsume
I'll gather up those loose, scattered passwords

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:21.470
Kakushin ni sematte yuku, sono shoutai o misete
And approach the core, so show me that true form

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:23.680
Kantan ni clear dekinai
I can't clear it easily

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.350
Saki nante motto yomenai
Can read what lies ahead even less

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.350
Kaidoku fukanou smile
A smile that can't be deciphered

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.650
Kiken na puzzle
A dangerous puzzle

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:32.570
Lock sareteta door aru nara
If there's a door that's been locked

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.400
Zutto tataite miru beki, kaza-ana hiraku wa
You must keep striking it, a crack will open

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.910
Eien ni hodokenai nazo nanka wa nai
No mystery remains unsolved forever

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.200
Makiokosu, it's a supernova!
It's forming, it's a supernova!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.870
Tobikiri shigekiteki na hirameki o agemashou
I will give you thoroughly stimulating insight

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:49.120
Misskey-misskey la-tu-ma

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.460
Yume no naka, it's a supernova!
In the middle of a dream, it's a supernova!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.090
Watashi wa, sou, brain diver
I am, yes, a brain diver

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:59.970
Kimi ga sagashimotometeru kotae ni nareru made
Until I become familiar with the answer you seek

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.640
Brain diver

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:10.440
Brain diver

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:19.030
Blue Sun, Red Moon

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.660
And therefore!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.810
We'll now begin a Word Chain

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:25.950
Championship to commemorate
Kaito's release!

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:28.460
Sheeit! Why we gotta do this?

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.220
So Kaito can forget, just a little,
the hardship he's gone through.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.610
That is our goal.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.380
Un..Understood!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.680
But right now, I've got it harder!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.010
Okay, I'll start us off.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:45.710
The word chain begins with "R":

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:48.720
Reverse Suplex!

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.520
Okay, Gammon, you're next!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.080
"X"?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.550
Uh, X marks the spot.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.680
Okay, Cube, we have "T," okay? "T!"

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.260
Huh? "T"?

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.760
Totally worthless.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.290
Oh dear, what's the matter, Cube?

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.910
All right, Ana, "S"!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.100
Siniac's Rue Pont des Arts.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.020
Uh, what is that?

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.950
Um...

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.290
Very well, our guest
of honor today, Kaito!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.430
"Arts"!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:14.790
"R"?

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:16.920
Rook...

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.590
Ah! It's my turn, huh?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:26.510
"K"?

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:29.250
Krazy Cyclone!

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.810
Huh? Oh, we're finished.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.520
Tee-hee.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:37.640
Next, we have Cube's
Interesting Inventions segment!

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.750
Huh?!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.020
Come on, whip something out.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.880
Some tool to take care of bullies,

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.270
or a tool to not get a zero on a test.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.780
Kaito's waiting!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.290
Kaito...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.430
Do you not think that someone
possessing such capabilities

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:57.800
is more suited to be
Kaito Daimon's companion?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.960
Well, "genius"?

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:05.050
There's nothing that I can do.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.390
Cube?

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:11.090
Yo, Cubik, what's gotten into ya?

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:13.640
Did the POG bully you or somethin'?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.520
Hey, don't tell me...

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.860
Did he do something to you?

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:21.280
Rook?!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.950
No, it's nothing.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.530
Really, it's nothing, Kaito.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:39.210
Just what did those times mean?!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.810
Kaito, where are you going?

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.210
To tear Rook a new one.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.340
That guy's gonna get it!

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.850
Wait, Kaito!

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.950
It's my fault.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:57.020
He's a real sonofabitch, this Rook.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.820
To do somethin' like that to Kaito...

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:04.490
I, Ana, think Kaito is a blue sun,

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.110
and he is a red moon.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.740
But it's strange.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.340
Both are so far away, so...

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.560
How were they able to meet?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.010
This is it.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.520
I will find out where he is.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.870
Hey, Kaito, let's stop this.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.020
We'll get in trouble!

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.090
This isn't a classroom, is it?

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:58.020
Is it a research lab?

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.860
It looks like a prison, huh?

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.150
What's it doing here?

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.500
Hey, Kaito, what is this place?

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:10.940
Hey, Kaito!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.680
Rook Banjo Crossfield!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.940
Rook?

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.690
A puzzle...

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.570
We can't go in unless we solve this, huh?

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:48.340
You in here, Rook?!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.380
What is this?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.710
Kid's clothing? Why?

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.540
It's Rook's room.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:09.650
Ten years ago, this is where he lived.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.540
Here in this place...

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:15.910
That's...

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.330
What's that?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.720
No!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.780
Kaito, let's just go.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.510
Something's wrong with him.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.320
But Jin's been taken hostage.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.030
And also...

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.700
Rook...

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.710
It's still here, huh?

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.710
This was the route we
took the first night

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.480
we met to go explore the ruins.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.920
But that memory, too...

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.490
It was all lies!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:19.890
Kaito...

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.290
He's lied to me since we were children.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.850
I was an idiot to have
believed in that smile!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:47.270
I think I still believed in him a little.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.460
In Rook.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.820
But today, I learned it all too well.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.510
He's dangerous.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:58.890
It's no good at all for
Kaito to get near him.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:04.350
I, Ana, think that
memories will never fade.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.820
They're like paintbrushes:

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:10.130
No matter how many new colors
they're stained with,

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.860
the colors of the past remain.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.250
Without fail.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.900
Then, what should we do?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.950
At this rate, the sun will disappear.

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:24.780
And it will be that boy's time.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.610
Before that happens...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:45.640
<i>I'm making a new wooden
cross puzzle right now.</i>

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.600
<i>When it's finished, I'll give it to you.</i>

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.330
<i>Huh? Really?</i>

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:53.780
<i>And always keep that puzzle on you, okay?</i>

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:57.030
<i>And every time you see it, remember me.</i>

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.870
<i>Okay! Thank you, Rook!</i>

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:07.310
Just what did that promise mean?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.740
Lying bastard.

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:14.870
Nonoha, what are you
doing here this late?

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.760
Sorry, did I wake you?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.220
Ana hasn't been by, right?

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.270
He's not there, at the hotel.

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:24.530
Not there?

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.520
Where would he go at this hour?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.400
Maybe...

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.030
What is it?

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:35.640
I told him, about the ruins
you and Rook went to.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.020
I can hear it.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.210
Correct. Yes.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.770
The puzzle was quickly reformed,

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:23.140
and Da Vinci should soon
notice the invitation.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.040
Good timing!

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.090
Y..You're Da Vinci!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.090
But the invitation was only just sent!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.420
Why are you already here?

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.840
Is this okay?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.900
That's addressed to Ana, right?

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.550
Can't be helped; Ana ain't here!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.150
Huh? What the heck is this?

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:43.550
Beats me...

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:47.020
I don't know nothin' about pictures!

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:50.030
More than pictures, it
looks like a cryptogram.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:53.560
A puzzle?!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.320
Well fine, this will
save me some trouble.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:04.870
You who bear the title of "Da Vinci"
shall have two options!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.000
Wow, it's huge!

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:08.570
One is to remove yourself
from Kaito Daimon.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.920
The other is to die by this

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.780
I'm sure it's quite heavy.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:12.960
Great Henge puzzle this very night!

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:12.960
Why was it moved here?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:15.350
Hey, listen, why don't you?!

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:15.880
Huh?

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:21.380
Say, Kaito, what is this "Great Henge"?

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:24.160
You know the Stonehenge ruins?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:28.100
Those big rocks all lined
up in a circle, right?

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.220
It's a stone circle, the same as that.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:36.510
Stonehenge was designed to track
the position of the summer sun,

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:39.080
so it's been called the
"ancient observatory."

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:45.430
But no one knows what
Great Henge was made for.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:51.170
But one day, Jin told us:

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:55.000
it's a giant puzzle
constructed by the ancients.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:59.050
Rook and I would slip out of school

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.090
at night to solve that puzzle.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:07.010
I didn't know that would be
a memory I'd never forget...

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:15.540
It's calling me.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.150
Oh, my, you'd do better not to approach.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.460
Great Henge is constructed
such that those

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.860
who draw near it shall be flattened!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:26.610
Splat?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:29.650
Yes, splat!

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.740
Unless you take the proper route...

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:36.220
A frail girl like you, there'd
be nothing left of her!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.530
I see you've been left speechless.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.970
I, Ana, am a boy.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.890
What?!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:49.360
You're a boy?!

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:52.470
Th..There'd be nothing
left of a boy, either!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.640
Yes, it would have no bearing!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.870
So you're a boy, so what?!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:01.750
I..In any case, I'll explain the rules.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.200
You must solve the puzzle of Great Henge

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.980
and find the route that will

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:08.660
let you make it alive to the goal.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.470
Your hint is...

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:20.330
Oh, you want to be with Kaito, don't you?

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.440
Huh?!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.840
Ana Gram, sixteen years old.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.420
Here I go!

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.840
W..Wait, I haven't
given you the hint yet!

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.140
No worries, no worries.

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:34.290
This kid!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.390
This is my least favorite type!

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.870
Listen, follow only a route that is
marked with a moon symbol.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:44.400
If you take one marked with a sun,
the rocks will collapse!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.740
And there's a time limit...

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.500
Five minutes!

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.790
If you take more than five minutes,
all the rocks will fall!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.270
Hey, are you listening?!

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:00.150
This is Great Henge?

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.040
A..Ana!

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:04.820
What's he doing?!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:05.840
Wait there!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.330
So you've come, Kaito Daimon.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.640
But the puzzle has already begun.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:16.640
If you barge into the puzzle
now, all the rocks will fall.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.410
And your friend will go splat.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:20.840
You're POG?

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:22.980
I won't believe a bluff like that!

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.610
Then why not try it for yourself?

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.230
Everything has gone as
Master Rook foresaw.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.950
Rook...

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.740
That wasn't the puzzle!

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.750
Ten years ago, when Rook and I came here,

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:43.310
it wasn't some hideous puzzle like this!

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.540
Kaito...

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:49.260
He doesn't give a damn about
the time we spent together.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.760
This puzzle is the real him!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.750
Ah, over there!

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.390
Ana, get back here!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.130
Ana!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.650
Oh, Kaito!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.620
Don't come back!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.490
The stones will fall!

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.150
Huh?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:15.170
You two! Would you
kindly stop butting in?

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.670
It's dangerous!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.410
I, Ana, think there's
nothing to worry about!

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.250
Ana?

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.500
After all, I saw the
answer from the start.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.510
If Stonehenge is the sun,
Great Henge is the moon!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.010
What was that?

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.800
Great Henge is the moon?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.430
Oh!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.040
The stones aren't a circle:

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.050
They're really arranged in the
position of the moon, huh?

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:48.270
So if you follow the path marked
by the moon symbols...

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.020
He really saw it?

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.700
That boy...

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:06.080
I, Ana, think puzzle time is now over!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.420
Impossible...

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.290
He really solved it.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.080
You all right?!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.930
Gammon! Cube!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.780
Sorry we're late!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:23.930
I ain't used to picture puzzles,
and solvin' it took some time!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.100
This is the answer!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.690
If you fold both sides together
and look through them...

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:31.530
You see the words "Great Henge"!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.280
There ain't no puzzle I can't solve!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.090
Puzzle time, let's begin!

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:38.950
Uh, no, no.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.080
Oh, Ana!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.120
Okabe, save Ana!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.630
No, don't!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.390
Go, Okabe!

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.510
Ana!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.820
M..My Great Henge...

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.120
Wh..Where's Ana?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.080
Ana!

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.050
It's Ana!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.900
Thank goodness.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.010
Huh? What's with that shape?

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.300
It's a crescent moon.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.670
That's the true form of the
moon-based Great Henge.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:47.810
Ana saw that form right
from the start, huh?

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.830
You called to Ana, didn't you?

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.580
And, hup!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:08.180
Ana, why did you come out here alone?

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.090
Here!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.020
It called out.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:15.100
This little guy has wanted
to see you for a long time.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.630
"To Kaito. From Rook."

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:25.390
<i>I'm making a new wooden
cross puzzle right now.</i>

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.310
<i>When it's finished, I'll give it to you.</i>

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:30.330
Rook's puzzle...

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:33.590
He actually finished it?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.320
<i>Ah, we couldn't solve it.</i>

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.450
<i>This puzzle is too hard.</i>

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:46.500
<i>Say, Kaito...</i>

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:49.330
<i>Let's come out here every day.</i>

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:53.330
<i>Let's solve this puzzle
by the time we're adults!</i>

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:55.610
<i>Yeah, let's do it!</i>

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.460
<i>Let's come every day.</i>

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:04.390
<i>Oh, Kaito, about that puzzle I
mentioned the other day...</i>

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:08.020
<i>This will not do, Mr. Rook.</i>

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:11.140
<i>Unauthorized leave from the
facility is prohibited.</i>

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.320
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.650
<i>You head back as well.</i>

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.540
<i>Kaito, go.</i>

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:36.870
<i>Rook, let's solve puzzles again tomorrow!</i>

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.840
That was the last time I saw him.

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:50.930
It's warm.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.440
This warmth is how Rook was back then.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:21:00.190
I, Ana, think that the child never lied.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:04.200
Ten years ago, he really
did care about you.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.170
Thank you, Ana.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.540
That puzzle...

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.660
I thought it was long lost.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:24.810
<i>No!</i>

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.100
<i>Let go! Let go!</i>

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:37.270
<i>No! I don't want to go back there!</i>

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:41.400
<i>My, my, so you've learned
emotions such as these?</i>

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.090
<i>Let go!</i>

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.340
<i>The program will have to be restructured.</i>

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:48.910
<i>Kaito...</i>

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:04.880
It was there all along.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:07.180
Master Rook?

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.520
Look, the sun's out again.

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:28.520
Rook...

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:41.540
Tsukue no ue de umareta sekai
A world born on top of a desk

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:47.340
Ichiban saki ni kimi ni misetakatta
I wanted to show it to you first of all

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:52.090
Karappo no heya sotto nukedashite
I sneaked silently out of that empty room

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:57.210
Hashirihajimeteta
And started running

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:02.610
Iki hazumasete oka o noboru to
Breathing heavily, I climbed the hill

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:08.220
Kimi ga saki ni tsuite matte ita ne
And you were already there, waiting

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:13.160
Takusan no hajimete kimi to mitsuketa
There were so many treasures that I first

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:17.910
Takaramono datta
Discovered with you

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.020
Kanashisa de afureta toki wa
That time when I was overcome with sadness

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:26.600
Nanimo iwazu ni tada
You said nothing

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:29.250
Soba ni ite kureta ne
Just stayed there by my side, didn't you?

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:33.910
Imademo wasurenai yo
Even now, I haven't forgotten

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:39.180
Mata aou ne, yakusoku o shiyou
Let's meet again, let's make it a promise

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:44.400
Kei wa shinai, ano hi no sayonara
It won't fade, the "goodbye" of that day

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:50.050
Boku no subete, kimi ga kureta michi
Everything I have, the path you gave me

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:58.960
Zutto kokoro no naka hikaru yo
Will always shine within my heart

00:24:03.660 --> 00:24:05.740
First England, now Italy?

00:24:05.740 --> 00:24:08.040
When did this turn into a travel show?

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:10.120
Who cares about such things?

00:24:10.120 --> 00:24:12.840
Just enjoy a relaxing boat ride.

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.260
I don't feel like...

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:15.410
Wait, who are you?

00:24:15.410 --> 00:24:17.290
How cruel, I'm Souji Jikukawa!

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:18.430
You're a POG, aren't you?

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:19.740
You sound nothing like him!

00:24:19.740 --> 00:24:22.190
Next time, "Labyrinth of Condemnation"

00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:26.920
Labyrinth of Condemnation

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:24.730
Oh, my cover was blown?

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:27.770
Looks like I have to practice a bit more.
